a">Mathematics and intellectual life · 32 min read · <time datetime="2026-10-12">October 12, 2026</time> · Revised <time datetime="2026-11-09">November 9, 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/essays/mathematical-life-in-the-age-of-ai">Mathematical Life in the Age of AI</a></h3><p class="essay-subtitle">Understanding, judgment, and the freedom to inquire</p><p>How people acquire the means to understand and pursue mathematics, and how AI changes the responsibilities of institutions that cultivate and judge those capacities.</p><div class="text-links essay-index-actions" data-essay-downloads="mathematical-life-in-the-age-of-ai"><a href="/essays/mathematical-life-in-the-age-of-ai">Read the essay</a><a href="/assets/essays/mathematical-life-in-the-age-of-ai.ef71774f3c17d4b8.pdf" aria-label="Download PDF of Mathematical Life in the Age of AI">PDF</a><a href="/assets/essays/mathematical-life-in-the-age-of-ai.12a628c839eb824c.md" aria-label="Download text of Mathematical Life in the Age of AI (.md)">Text (.md)</a></div></article><article class="essay-card"><p class="meta">Institutions and intellectual life · 10 min read · <time datetime="2026-10-28">October 28, 2026</time> · Revised <time datetime="2026-11-09">November 9, 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/essays/what-sustains-mathematical-expertise">What Sustains Mathematical Expertise</a></h3><p class="essay-subtitle">Understanding, employment, and independent capability</p><p>How the value of mathematical understanding connects to paid expertise, and what arrangements can sustain the independent capabilities on which mathematical life depends.</p><div class="text-links essay-index-actions" data-essay-downloads="what-sustains-mathematical-expertise"><a href="/essays/what-sustains-mathematical-expertise">Read the essay</a><a href="/assets/essays/what-sustains-mathematical-expertise.198506955c3911bc.pdf" aria-label="Download PDF of What Sustains Mathematical Expertise">PDF</a><a href="/assets/essays/what-sustains-mathematical-expertise.b0c63524582e730b.md" aria-label="Download text of What Sustains Mathematical Expertise (.md)">Text (.md)</a></div></article></section><section class="essay-group" aria-labelledby="institutions-essays"><h2 id="institutions-essays" class="essay-group-label">Institutions and judgment</h2><p class="essay-group-description">How prestige and incentives shape inquiry, and what makes consequential judgments answerable.</p><p class="essay-feature-reference"><a href="#featured-polemics-essay">Purity, Prestige, and Pettiness</a> is featured above.</p><article class="essay-card"><p class="meta">Institutions and intellectual life · 11 min read · <time datetime="2026-10-19">October 19, 2026</time> · Revised <time datetime="2026-11-10">November 10, 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/essays/when-accountability-stops-being-reciprocal">When Accountability Stops Being Reciprocal</a></h3><p class="essay-subtitle">Moral authority and the permanent defendant</p><p>How accusations acquire institutional force, why scrutiny can become costly, and what makes consequential judgments open to challenge and correction.</p><div class="text-links essay-index-actions" data-essay-downloads="when-accountability-stops-being-reciprocal"><a href="/essays/when-accountability-stops-being-reciprocal">Read the essay</a><a href="/assets/essays/when-accountability-stops-being-reciprocal.3306e6bf795ce2c1.pdf" aria-label="Download PDF of When Accountability Stops Being Reciprocal">PDF</a><a href="/assets/essays/when-accountability-stops-being-reciprocal.4354c37b7513d7d6.md" aria-label="Download text of When Accountability Stops Being Reciprocal (.md)">Text (.md)</a></div></article><article class="essay-card"><p class="meta">Institutions and intellectual life · 17 min read · <time datetime="2026-10-19">October 19, 2026</time> · Revised <time datetime="2026-11-09">November 9, 2026</time></p><h3><a href="/essays/the-performance-of-depth">The Performance of Depth</a></h3><p class="essay-subtitle">Prestige, incentives, and